   "speechStart": 2.6,
   "end": 4.675,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Anything that raises G."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 4.925,
   "speechStart": 4.925,
   "end": 7.5,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Add weight high up, and G goes up."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 7.75,
   "speechStart": 7.75,
   "end": 9.75,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Passengers in a tower."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 10.0,
   "speechStart": 10.0,
   "end": 12.35,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Gear stacked on the cabin top."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 12.6,
   "speechStart": 12.6,
   "end": 15.95,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "The second enemy is sneakier: free surface."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 16.2,
   "speechStart": 16.2,
   "end": 22.65,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Liquid sloshing in a half-full tank runs to the low side when you heel, and it pushes you over further."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 22.9,
   "speechStart": 22.9,
   "end": 25.175,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "It acts just like raising G."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 25.425,
   "speechStart": 25.425,
   "end": 30.475,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "So keep tanks either full or empty when you can, and keep the bilges dry."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 30.725,
   "speechStart": 30.725,
   "end": 32.725,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Here’s the useful part."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 32.975,
   "speechStart": 32.975,
   "end": 35.8,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "You can feel your stability through your feet."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 36.05,
   "speechStart": 36.05,
   "end": 40.35,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "A quick, snappy roll means a stiff boat, with a large G M."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 40.6,
   "speechStart": 40.6,
   "end": 47.95,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "A slow, lazy roll, where she leans over and takes her time coming back, means a tender boat, with a small G M."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 48.2,
   "speechStart": 48.2,
   "end": 53.975,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "And if your boat rolls lazier this afternoon than she did this morning, what’s that telling you?"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 54.225,
   "speechStart": 54.975,
   "end": 56.775,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Something changed."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 57.025,
   "speechStart": 57.025,
   "end": 58.7,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Look for water."
